# Staphylococcus aureus, the 14 locus MLVA of Pourcel et al. 2009, in two multiplex panels.
# Panel 1 is the ten first-step loci and panel 2 the four second-step loci, in that order, so a
# profile string reads as the published one.
#
# Primers are Table 1 of Pourcel et al. 2009 as published. Two carry an IUPAC ambiguity code, an R
# in the Sa1729 forward and the Sa1425 reverse primer, as printed. The assay labels one sense primer
# of each pair with a fluorescent dye; the label is not part of the oligonucleotide and is not here.
#
# The search window is derived, not published: it runs from the length of the amplicon with no
# repeat to twenty repeats beyond the Mu50 product.

Sa0122	AGCAGTAGTGCCGTTTGCTT	AAGACGATCCTTCAGTGAGCA	152-872
Sa0266	TTGGATATGAAGCGAGACCA	CTTCCGATTGTTCGATGCTT	144-2250
Sa0311	AGGGTTAGAGCCCGAGACAT	CACGGGATTGGAACAGAAAT	107-1372
Sa0704	CGCGCGTGAATCTCTTTTAT	AGTCCCATATCGTGCGTTAAA	112-1720
Sa1132	CGTGCATAATGGCTTACGAA	AAGCAGCAGAAAAAGCTAAAGAA	154-1792
Sa1194	AGTGCAAGCGGAAATTGAAG	ATCGTGAAAAAGCCCAAAAA	60-1864
Sa1291	GGGGGAAATTCTAAGCAACC	CGAAATTTTCCACGTCGATT	113-1649
Sa1729	TACTTAAAAATARGAATACATAATTAG	CAACAATAAATTACTTATTTGAAGTT	219-1619
Sa1866	CTGTTTTGCAGCGTTTGCTA	GCAACTTGAAGAAACGGTTG	130-3787
Sa2039	TTCGTTCTACCCCAACTTGC	GAGCCTGGGTCATAAATTCAA	114-1402
Sa0906	CATGTATTCATGGGATTGCAGC	CAGATTTTCCTTCAACAATTATCAC	696-1984
Sa1213	GGCTGATGCTAAAGTTGCATTAGA	GTGGCATGTTCTACAAACGTAAAC	588-1988
Sa1425	TCGTTATTAAACTACGAATTCTCGATT	ATTTCGRGAATGATTCAATTCAATTTT	398-1790
Sa1756	AATTATAGCATATTAGAGCCCCTTA	ACGTAAAGGTCGCGACAAAA	103-2985
